:name: PX4 fmu-v6xrt boot bring-up on the jess RT1176 Renode platform (DD-008 stage 2)
:description: Boots the real PX4 fmu-v6xrt firmware on the hand-authored RT1176
:description: platform + the discovered peripheral stubs. Run the boot->unhandled-
:description: access->stub loop to march toward the nsh console.
#
# Prereqs (not committed — see README.md):
#   $PX4BIN = the extracted PX4 image (extract-px4-image.py on px4_fmu-v6xrt_default.px4)
#   loaded at the flash origin 0x30020000. Entry/SP/PC come from the i.MX RT IVT
#   (entry vector table @ 0x30022000; SP 0x202587fc; Reset 0x300223a9).

mach create "px4-v6xrt"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @hardware/renode/pixhawk6xrt.repl
machine LoadPlatformDescription @hardware/renode/px4/pixhawk6xrt-px4-extras.repl
sysbus LoadBinary $PX4BIN 0x30020000
cpu VectorTableOffset 0x30022000
cpu PC 0x300223a9
cpu SP 0x202587fc
